        "sha": "ade002d2bf4facf082ed8cc68cad4e63233e18f4",
        "date": "2026-06-14T06:47:49Z",
        "message": "P3.2: Corner headers + 'wait for whistle' set-piece realism\n\nTwo fixes to set pieces:\n\n1) In-match corners now actually whip the ball in for headers. The\n   match-rules restart (setupCorner) previously placed the ball with the\n   taker but never flagged it as a set piece, so the taker just dribbled.\n   Now setupCorner/setupFreeKick set state.setPiece so the taker delivers\n   via the set-piece logic. Corner delivery + header resolution reworked:\n   - attackers are sent to varied header spots (near post, penalty spot,\n     far post, edge) and anchored there (setPieceAnchor) so normal\n     off-ball logic can't drag them out of the box before the ball lands\n   - delivery picks a zone (near/central/far); the aimed, least-marked\n     attacker gets a duel bonus so attacking headers happen regularly\n   - resolveCrossArrival branches for corners: attacker win -> header on\n     goal (glancing/powerful/far-post) via the shot pipeline with a\n     header xG factor; near-post deliveries can be flicked on to the far\n     post for a second chance; defender win -> headed clear (sometimes\n     out for another corner)\n   - attemptShot gains a shotKind param ('header') -> lower xG + \"Header\"\n     wording in events\n\n2) \"Wait for the whistle\" before every set piece: the taker holds for\n   ~1.3s while runners take up position, the referee whistles (~0.4s\n   before contact, with a whistle sound wired in main.js), then the kick\n   is taken — instead of an instant restart.\n\nBalance: ~4 corners/match producing real header chances, ~0.3 header\ngoals/match. New tests/p32-setpiece-headers.mjs (whistle-before-kick\nordering, corner always whipped in, headers fire, taker never dribbles)\npasses 10/10; all 12 suites green.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_011quKsFr7AzVsKi6dbzMCFr"
      },
